From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jaime Dias <jaimejosediasnt@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 18:59:32 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] DEBUG: turn on tracing in dos, lddemon and Shell

Bring-up aid, not part of the port. Enables the existing D() tracing in
the boot and shell paths, which is where a new architecture spends most
of its early failures.

Applied last and touching nothing else, so it can be dropped without
disturbing the rest of the series.
---
 rom/dos/boot.c            | 1 +
 rom/dos/cliinit.c         | 1 +
 rom/dos/newcliproc.c      | 1 +
 rom/dos/shell_helper.c    | 1 +
 rom/dos/systemtaglist.c   | 1 +
 rom/lddemon/lddemon.c     | 1 +
 workbench/c/Shell/Shell.c | 1 +
 7 files changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/rom/dos/boot.c b/rom/dos/boot.c
index adf0a3684a..8076faf602 100644
--- a/rom/dos/boot.c
+++ b/rom/dos/boot.c
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
     Desc: Implements AROS's generic/amiga-like boot sequence.
 */
 
+#define DEBUG 1
 #include <aros/debug.h>
 #include <exec/alerts.h>
 #include <exec/libraries.h>
diff --git a/rom/dos/cliinit.c b/rom/dos/cliinit.c
index 218cb9a579..4efec393b2 100644
--- a/rom/dos/cliinit.c
+++ b/rom/dos/cliinit.c
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
     Desc:
 */
 
+#define DEBUG 1
 #include <aros/debug.h>
 #include <exec/resident.h>
 #include <proto/exec.h>
